+- Added **pre-filtering** rules in `CvCityAI::AI_buildingValue` so hammers go where they matter: skip walls when safe/strong; avoid wonders when weak/in danger (focus on core cities if relevant); keep early culture to BFC needs; do **not** block economy/growth buildings; fall back to base logic after the pre-filters. AIs tend to value **Heroic/National Epics** more and build them in top-hammer cities. See **[KI#48](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#48---enhancedreworked-ai-building-walls-when-they-are-stronger-and-dont-need-it-or-wonders-when-they-are-weaker-or-in-danger-dont-build-wonders-for-our-neighbours-when-they-capture-us-and-overall-added-a-lot-of-extra-buildingvalue-reject-orand-always-build-first-logic-depending-on-building-type-andor-such-anyways-etc--and-reworked-as-well-the-ditching-wonders-logic-to-be-seemingly-stricter-and-more-wardanger-focused-anyways-etc)**. Note: AdvCiv-SAS uses a quite strict low wonder policy, as early settlers and workers are more valuable generally and a stronger choice; plus later on we have little time to build many as we risk being overrun by our rivals and building wonders for them as they conquer us, which is a poor choice. A mostly Base AdvCiv-like behaviour of AIs building many wonders can be restored in SAS defines by disabling `SAS_AI_BUILDING_VALUE_WORLD_WONDERS_OPTIMIZE` (e.g. 0 vs 6 wonders at turn 100 in an autoplay sample with vs without it).
 - **Happiness buildings — urgency & growth accounting**: Improved AI building selection to (1) correctly flag **strict/urgent happiness** buildings (now using, in our prechecks, the new `AI_strictAdditionalHappy` instead of the too-broad `CvCity::getAdditionalHappinessByBuilding`) and (2) factor in the **expected food regained** once unhappy citizens become workable again. Result: noticeably better choices and pacing. See **[KI#48.2](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#482---greatly-enhanced-and-fixed-kish-city-of-gilgamesh-ai-building-a-theatre-instead-of-a-hindu-temple-despite-having-unhappy-citizens-and-health-room-to-grow-otherwise-anyways-etc-and-theatre-not-giving-any-reliable-happiness-almost-anything-else-would-have-been-much-better-fixed-by-fixed-by-correcting-the-happiness-building-formula-in-our-pre-check-in-cvcityaiai_buildingvalue-and-in-particular-replacing-the-too-broad-and-unreliable-cvcitygetadditionalhappinessbybuilding-with-our-own-ai_strictadditionalhappy-anyways-etc)**.
 
